  "info": {
    "name": "JiStudio Shopee Global E-Commerce, Live & Affiliate API (13 Routes · 8 Markets)",
    "description": "Real-time multi-region e-commerce product intelligence (~250ms latency) supporting all 8 Shopee markets: Vietnam (vn), Indonesia (id), Thailand (th), Philippines (ph), Malaysia (my), Singapore (sg), Taiwan (tw), and Brazil (br). Fetch unrounded sold counts, batch 20 products/call, multi-warehouse stock, livestream shopping bag items, daily discover trends, keyword autocomplete & matched shops, shop profiles, and affiliate commission links. Independent public market research and affiliate utility; not affiliated with or endorsed by Shopee or Sea Limited.\n\nGet your free RapidAPI key at: https://rapidapi.com/Techssss/api/shopee-e-commerce-live-affiliate-intelligence\nOpen-source SDKs & MCP servers: https://github.com/jistudio-dev",
